   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of blindness and education centre for kids who attend nursery schools in Uzhorod</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Zriadenie vzdel&#xe1;vacieho centra pre zrakovo postihnut&#xe9; deti nav&#x161;tevuj&#xfa;ce matersk&#xfa; &#x161;k&#xf4;lku v U&#x17e;horode</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of the project is to: 1. ensure equal access and equality of opportunities to the pre-school education for visually handicapped kids via establishing the blindness and education centre in Uzhorod, 2. implement the methods of teaching for blind kids in local nursery schools, 3. conduct mass media campaign aimed at support of blindness and education centre in Uzhorod&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&#xa0;Cie&#x13e;om projektu je zabezpe&#x10d;i&#x165; rovnak&#xfd; pr&#xed;stup a kvalitu pr&#xed;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; v pred&#x161;kolskom vzdel&#xe1;van&#xed; pre deti so zrakov&#xfd;m postihnut&#xed;m prostredn&#xed;ctvom zalo&#x17e;enia centra v U&#x17e;horode, implement&#xe1;cia met&#xf3;d zrakovo postihnut&#xfd;ch det&#xed; v &#x161;k&#xf4;lke a kampa&#x148; s cie&#x13e;om podpory tohto centra.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
